<section class="section dark-section">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">A clear, collaborative process</div>
<h2>Start with a conversation. Build with purpose.</h2>
</div>
<a class="btn lime" href="contact.html">Tell us what you need</a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-4 steps">
<article class="step">
<h3>Tell us about it</h3>
<p>Share your business, goals, budget and timing. No commitment required.</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
<h3>Agree the scope</h3>
<p>We clarify what’s included, what you’ll provide and the project estimate.</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
<h3>Review the direction</h3>
<p>We share a design direction and agree revisions before finalising.</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
<h3>Prepare to launch</h3>
<p>We check the agreed pages and hand over the launch requirements transparently.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="wrap split">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Why a website?</div>
<h2>Your online home, on your terms.</h2>
<p>Social profiles can help people discover you, but a website gives you a place to explain your offer in your own way. It can answer common questions, make your services easier to compare and give customers one clear path to enquire.</p>
<p>A website is not a promise of search rankings or sales. It is a practical, ownable foundation that can support your wider business presence.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Made to do the basics well</h3>
<ul class="check-list">
<li>Make your services easy to understand</li>
<li>Look and work well on a phone</li>
<li>Give visitors useful next steps</li>
<li>Grow in scope when your business is ready</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">A growing startup</div>
<h2>Building our reputation one good project at a time.</h2>
<p>VENDERS.CO is a startup with a simple mission: make thoughtful digital work accessible to businesses at different stages, from independent founders to established teams. We’re building our portfolio through useful demonstrations, clear scopes and honest communication — not borrowed credentials or made-up success stories.</p>
<a class="btn secondary" href="about.html">Get to know us</a>
</div>
<article class="card">
<span class="tag">What we stand for</span>
<h3 style="margin-top:20px">Good work. Clear expectations.</h3>
<p>Affordability shouldn’t mean cutting corners on clarity, accessibility or care. We focus on practical scope, thoughtful design and open conversations about what a project needs.</p>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section">
<div class="wrap split">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Content & visibility</div>
<h2>Sharing the journey — honestly.</h2>
<p>We’re developing our digital marketing capabilities. Short-form promotional content, content planning and promotional graphics are planned services; they are not currently offered as a confirmed package. Basic website content and visibility improvements may be discussed as part of a website project.</p>
<p>Our future content will share website transformations, industry demos, practical business tips and behind-the-scenes startup progress.</p>
<a class="btn secondary" data-tiktok href="contact.html">Follow our journey</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="icon">▶</div>
<h3>Marketing plans: coming soon</h3>
<p>We’ll clearly announce availability when the offer and delivery process are ready. No follower count or social platform outcome is promised.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section soft">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow">Frequently asked</div>
<h2>A few useful answers.</h2>
</div>
<a href="contact.html" class="btn secondary">Ask us something</a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-2">
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>How much does a website cost?</summary>
<p>Our introductory estimates depend on scope. A one-page site is estimated at R499–R799; see the pricing page for inclusions, exclusions and quote details.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Can a website fit my business budget?</summary>
<p>We offer modest starting scopes and transparent estimates. We’ll discuss what fits your budget and can suggest a smaller first version if appropriate.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>How long will my project take?</summary>
<p>Timing depends on scope, content readiness and availability. We’ll discuss a realistic timeline after reviewing your requirements; no dates are guaranteed before assessment.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>What content do I need to provide?</summary>
<p>Usually your business details, services or products, contact information and any approved photos or brand assets. We’ll confirm the exact list for your project.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Will the website work on mobile?</summary>
<p>Responsive layouts are included in the website scopes described here. We also recommend testing content on your own phone before launch.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Do I need a domain name and hosting?</summary>
<p>A public website generally needs a domain and a hosting arrangement. These recurring costs are separate unless your written quote explicitly includes them.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Can you maintain my website?</summary>
<p>Optional maintenance may be discussed and quoted based on your site and support needs. It is not currently a fixed-price package.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Can you build an online store or payment integration?</summary>
<p>A basic store can be assessed from R3,000. Provider availability, fees, subscriptions and integration requirements must be confirmed before scope is agreed.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>How do I request a quotation?</summary>
<p>Use the enquiry form to tell us about your industry, service, budget and timeline. It prepares a message locally so you can choose how to share it.</p>
</details>
<details class="faq-item">
<summary>Can a demo be customised, or can I request a different design?</summary>
<p>Yes. Demos are fictional starting points, not fixed templates. Describe the style or direction you have in mind and we’ll assess it for a tailored scope.</p>
</details>
</div>
</div>
</section>
